    {
      "id": "seg_000",
      "start": 0.66,
      "end": 5.26,
      "text": "Many people think that foreign investment companies only change the language of China"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_001",
      "start": 5.26,
      "end": 8.86,
      "text": "but the first step of a Chinese investment company is completely different"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_002",
      "start": 8.86,
      "end": 11.86,
      "text": "The core of Chinese investment companies is the capital investment"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_003",
      "start": 11.86,
      "end": 16.46,
      "text": "Under the leadership of the government, no need to pay immediately, but this number is the company's credit card"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_004",
      "start": 16.46,
      "end": 19.46,
      "text": "The shareholder responsibility and the capital judgment will be around it"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_005",
      "start": 19.46,
      "end": 22.66,
      "text": "and the first thing in Thailand is not money, but the shareholder structure"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_006",
      "start": 22.66,
      "end": 26.06,
      "text": "Ordinary Thai companies usually need at least three shareholders"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_007",
      "start": 26.06,
      "end": 28.86,
      "text": "so the foreign capital ratio is usually less than 49%"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_008",
      "start": 29.26,
      "end": 34.46,
      "text": "In other words, the control power is locked in from the moment of the investment, and the money is returned"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_009",
      "start": 34.46,
      "end": 40.46,
      "text": "Look at the initial rhythm — China allows flexible capital timing; Thailand requires paid-in capital"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_010",
      "start": 40.46,
      "end": 47.06,
      "text": "Bank accounts, work permits and visa applications all watch whether capital has arrived — without it, later steps stall"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_011",
      "start": 47.06,
      "end": 55.86,
      "text": "Governance also differs — China emphasizes the legal representative; Thailand weights director authority, and many filings accept director signatures over company seals"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg_012",
      "start": 55.86,
      "end": 61.46,
      "text": "The difference is plain: China company formation looks at the numbers; Thailand looks at the structure"
    }
  ],
